#: positiontab_impl.cpp:49
msgid ""
"This sets the position of the panel i.e. the screen border it is attached "
"to. You can also change this position by left-clicking on some free space on "
"the panel and dragging it to a screen border."
msgstr ""
"hierdie verstel die posisie van die paneel i.e. die skerm grens dit is "
"gekoppelde aan. jy kan asook verander hierdie posisie deur left-clicking op "
"sommige vry spasie op die paneel en te trek dit aan 'n skerm grens."

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:54
msgid ""
"This sets the size of the panel. You can also access this option via the "
"panel context menu, i.e. by right-clicking on some free space on the panel."
msgstr ""
"hierdie verstel die grootte van die paneel. jy kan asook toegang verkry "
"hierdie opsie deur middel van die paneel konteks kieslys, i.e. deur "
"right-clicking op sommige vry spasie op die paneel."

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:58
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This setting determines how the panel is aligned, i.e. how it's positioned "
"on the panel edge. Note that in order for this setting to have any effect, "
"the panel size has to be set to a value of less than 100%"
msgstr ""
"hierdie opset bepaal hoe die paneel is opgelyn, i.e. hoe dit is "
"geposisioneer op die paneel rand. nota wat in volgorde vir hierdie opset aan "
"het enige effek, die paneel grootte het aan wees stel aan 'n waarde van "
"minder as 100%"

#: positiontab_impl.cpp:96 positiontab_impl.cpp:116
msgid "T&op"
msgstr "bo"

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:56
msgid ""
"If hide buttons are enabled, check this option to make the panel softly "
"slide away when you click on the hide buttons. Otherwise it will just "
"disappear."
msgstr ""
"as steek weg knoppies word geaktiveer, bevestig hierdie opsie aan maak die "
"paneel sagtens skuif weg wanneer jy kliek op die steek weg knoppies. "
"andersins dit sal net verdwyn."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:60
msgid ""
"Determines the speed of the hide animation, i.e. the animation shown when "
"you click on the panel's hide buttons."
msgstr ""

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:63
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically hide after some time "
"and reappear when you move the mouse to the screen edge the panel is "
"attached to. This is particularly useful for small screen resolutions, for "
"example, on laptops."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, die paneel sal automaties steek weg na "
"sommige tyd en herverskyn wanneer jy beweeg die muis aan die skerm rand die "
"paneel is gekoppelde aan. hierdie is in besonder bruikbare vir klein skerm "
"resolusie, vir voorbeeld, op skootrekenaars."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:69
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will automatically show itself for a "
"brief period of time when the desktop is switched so you can see which "
"desktop you are on."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, die paneel sal automaties vertoon self vir "
"'n kort periode van tyd wanneer die werkskerm is geskakel sodat jy kan sien "
"wat werkskerm jy word op."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Here you can change the delay after which the panel will disappear if not "
"used."
msgstr ""
"hier jy kan verander die vertraging na wat die paneel sal verdwyn as nie "
"gebruik word."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:79
msgid ""
"If auto-hide panel is enabled, check this option to make the panel softly "
"slide down after a certain amount of time. Otherwise it will just disappear."
msgstr ""
"as auto-hide paneel is geaktiveer, bevestig hierdie opsie aan maak die "
"paneel sagtens skuif ondertoe na 'n sekere hoeveelheid van tyd. andersins "
"dit sal net verdwyn."

#: hidingtab_impl.cpp:83
msgid ""
"Determines the speed of the auto-hide animation, i.e. the animation shown "
"when the panel disappears after a certain amount of time."
msgstr ""
"bepaal die spoed van die auto-hide animasie, i.e. die animasie vertoon "
"wanneer die paneel verdwyn na 'n sekere hoeveelheid van tyd."

#: extensionstab_impl.cpp:76 hidingtab_impl.cpp:87
msgid "Here you can change the size of the hide buttons."
msgstr "hier jy kan verander die grootte van die steek weg knoppies."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:58
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the panel will display panel buttons using tile "
"images instead of just drawing flat buttons. You can still enable or disable "
"usage of tiles for the different kinds of panel buttons, using the options "
"below."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, die paneel sal vertoon paneel knoppies te "
"gebruik teël beelde in plaas van van net teken plat knoppies. jy kan "
"nogsteeds aktiveer van deaktiveer gebruik van teëls vir die ander tipes van "
"paneel knoppies, te gebruik die opsies onder."

#: lookandfeeltab_impl.cpp:65
msgid ""
"If this option is enabled, the button icons are zoomed when the mouse cursor "
" is moved over them."
msgstr ""
"as hierdie opsie is geaktiveer, die knoppie ikoone word gezoem wanneer die "
"muis plekaanduier  is verskuif bo hulle."

